OL,3,GNEWSALeak leaves villagers questioning
OL,4,Ahosepipe ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FVillagers believe a water leak is
OL,7,Fwasting about 8,600 litres a day during
OL,8,Fa hosepipe ban.
OL,10,FResidents in Minting, Lincolnshire,
OL,11,Fsaid the leak was reported to Anglian
OL,12,FWater on 16 August and engineers had
OL,13,Fmarked out the location, but were yet
OL,14,Fto carry out repairs.
OL,16,FKevin Harris, who has measured the flow
OL,17,Fof water, said: "I've lived in this
OL,18,Fvillage for 40 years and I've never
OL,19,Fseen a leak like this. How many baths
OL,20,Fcould you have from that?"
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
