OL,3,GNEWSALeak leaves villagers questioning
OL,4,Ahosepipe ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this month, Anglian Water said
OL,7,Fits hosepipe ban may continue into the
OL,8,Fwinter, with parts of the region
OL,9,Fremaining in drought. The firm said the
OL,10,Fhot summer had led to more leaks and
OL,11,Fits team would fix the problem in
OL,12,FMinting "as soon as they can".
